  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  title: Raw Egg
  description: "This is a raw egg and it is an ingredient to create a cake batter.
    \r\nTo create a cake batter, the user need to put flour, egg and butter in mixer
    cup and mix the material.\r\nThe user can not add this egg directly in mixer
    cup.\r\nThe user need to put the egg first in bowl. Then use the fork to beat
    the egg.\r\nAfter that the user can pour the beated egg in mixer cup.\r\nBut
    if the mixer cup does not have flour inside, nothing will happens.\r\n"
  type: 0
  url: 
