    not add butter directly in mixer cup. To use it, the user must first melt it
    in the bowl. This is done by grabbing the butter and placing it into the bowl,
    which automatically turns it into a liquid. The melted butter can then be poured
    into the MixerCup by tilting the bowl, but only if the MixerCup already contains
    flour.
